  "theorem": "The 36 M36 Witting rays are not merely in bijection with the 36 temporal triangles.  In the explicit Witting-to-Bell gauge, each of the four nine-ray M36 families is exactly one parallel class of lightlike affine lines in Sym2(F3): all nine temporal triangles in a family have one common null direction q=0 and partition all 27 history points.  The four family directions are the four P1(F3) null directions already identified equivariantly with the four Hesse striations and the four A2 components.  The native M36 (mu,nu) labels are related to the quotient-plane coordinates by an explicit invertible affine 2x2 map for each family."
